## h i g h l i g h t s
Bimetallic metal-organic frameworks (Zn/Ti-MOF) were synthesized via microwave hydrothermal method. C-doped $Z_{\mathrm{nO/TiO_{2}}}$ particles were successfully synthesized by one-step controllable pyrolysis of $Z\mathrm{n/Ti}$ -MOF.  The as-prepared C-doped $Z_{\mathrm{nO/TiO}_{2}}$ exhibited a higher Rhodamine B photocatalytic degradation activity. The possible mechanism for the photocatalytic process of C-doped $Z_{\mathrm{nO}/\mathrm{TiO}_{2}}$ was proposed.
